Released in '''Beta 27.0''' as [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Determination Determination]'s 3rd [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Rare Rare] spell, Sacrifice is a 1G spell that lets you choose an ally monster of your choice. It will kill that monster, heal you by 4 HP and add a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Angel_of_Death Lost Soul] to your hand. '''Beta 43.0''' makes that Lost Soul cost 2G less.
[[File:Sacrifice (Beta 43.0).png|thumb|195x195px|Beta 43.0]]
'''Beta 46.1''' made it lose the chance to give [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Thrashing_Machine Thrashing Machine] from the pool of Lost Souls. It shares this change with both Angel of Death and [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Chaos_Blaster Chaos Blaster] (making the entire Tribe seperated from Thrashing Machine, similar to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Jevil Chaos Weapons]).
[[File:Sacrifice (Beta 46.1).png|thumb|195x195px|Beta 46.1]]
'''Beta 48.0''' reworked the class and many of its spells. Sacrifice was the only one to be replaced by another, this being [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Faded_Memory Faded Memory].

